        <mxCell id="conn1" value="VNPT MPLS / L3VPN — PRIMARY · private peering tới VNPT Cloud · QoS · SLA telco · 20–50 Mbps/site" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="545" width="540" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="conn2" value="Internet FTTH + IPsec VPN — BACKUP · SD-WAN auto-failover (FortiGate)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="615" width="540" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="conn3" value="GIAO THỨC — UPLINK: MQTT/TLS :8883 mTLS (telemetry · event · alarm · heartbeat · backfill) · HTTPS :443 (backup · metrics/logs · snapshot pre-signed URL) — DOWNLINK: MQTT (config · OTA ring rollout · remote command whitelist · 2FA · ack ≤ 5s)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="545" width="570" height="115" as="geometry" />
